1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:05,516
10,000 years, one world held the gates of hell shut.

2
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:12,083
Cadia, a fortress world, ringed with ancient pylons.

3
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:17,550
Its children were handed rifles before they could walk.

4
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:23,250
Twelve times, Abaddon the Despoiler led a Black Crusade.

5
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:26,850
Twelve times Cadia held.

6
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:31,250
On the 13th, he brought a star fortress,

7
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:34,527
and hurled it down.

8
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:39,527
The pylons shattered. The world split open.

9
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:45,406
Cadia fell. Its soldiers fought on in the ruins.

10
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:49,527
Cadia fell. But Cadia stands.
